    "created_at": "2021-05-28T18:09:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-05-28T18:09:54Z",
    "body": "Normal usage is `<link rel=prefetch as=iframe href=X>` and then `<iframe src=X>` both within the same context, right?  It looks to me like both your (1) and (2) support this when at the top level context, but only (2) supports it regardless of context.",
